      <p class="text-body-sm text-text-body-light font-dm-sans">Fail-closed: assume NOT safe for parallel execution.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="group relative border border-[#d2d0d0] rounded-[12px] p-[20px] hover:border-[#4a9ae8] hover:shadow-md transition-all cursor-default">
      <p class="font-bold text-text-heading mb-[6px] font-dm-sans">isReadOnly → false</p>
